# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file"). Save checks P5.3 and P5.4
# (port/test/README.md, "Save checks"; port/test/tools/savechk.sh). Hand-made from frame dumps
# of the played build, not from a TAS.
# Late-game save check, session 1. Start: e20_start.sav (~/fe8-chapsaves, the end save of route_e19.keys: Eirika's Chapter 20, Darkling Woods, a game save in slot 1 at the chapter's start; 31 units, supports, convoy). Title menu Restart Chapter, slot 1; the world map: L three times (the cursor to the Black Temple), A: the chapter's opening; the preparations' Save into game slot 2 (a full game block with the real army), Fight!; turn 1's player phase: the unit under the cursor (Eirika) waits, the map menu Suspend, Yes (suspend saves).
# 8600 ticks; each press is held 2 ticks. The played builds take it as FE8PC_KEYSCRIPT
# (port/test/tools/keys_to_keyscript.py; frame N is tick N on the lag-free PC).
